+# Release 1.5.0
+
+## Access control
+
+Access control decides which caller may perform an operation. Rules are
+attached to operations and evaluated before any side effect runs.
+
+## Retention window
+
+A retention window is the length of time an artifact must stay retrievable
+before cleanup is allowed.
+
+Notes count: 4
